        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Imperial DL-DB751, ADA Compliant Handicap Door Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Imperial ADA Compliant Single Cylinder Deadbolt is easy to install and will fit many standard doors that are 1-3/8\" to -3/4\" thick with a 2-3/4\" backset. This ADA Compliant Handicap Door Lock is made for residential and light duty commercial applications. Featuring a 6-pin Schlage \"C\" keyway, the Imperial USA DL-DB751 Deadbolt is easy to have <a href=\"/pages/lock-keying\">keyed</a> to match your existing Schlage locks, which means you'll only have one key for all our your doors. This ADA Compliant Handicap Door Lock is an ANSI grade 2 Single Cylinder Door Lock.  Available in either satin chrome or matte black finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DL-DB700 Series Handicap Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.2 grade 2 requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8” or 2-3/4″</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1-1/8\" x 2-1/4\" UL Listed, 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\" no-lip square corner</li>\r\n<li>1/4″ Heavy Gauge Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: 6 pin solid brass Schlage \"C\" keyway standard.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin chrome or matte black</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed and reversible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "ADA Compliant Single Cylinder Deadbolt, Imperial DL-DB751",
                "description": "The Imperial ADA Compliant Single Cylinder Deadbolt features a 6-pin Schlage C keyway so you know it is both secure, and easy to have keyed to match your existing Schlage locks. This ADA Compliant Handicap Door Lock meets ANSI grade 2 requirements. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. For residential and light duty commercial applications.",
                "keywords": "ADA Compliant Deadbolts, Imperial USA DL-DB751-BK, Imperial USA DL-DB751-626, Handicap Door Locks, ada deadbolts, ada compliant door hardware, ada compliant locks, DL-DB700 Series Residential Tubular Deadbolts, DL-DB700 Series Grade 2 Deadbolts, global door controls DL-DB700 deadbolts, trans atlantic deadbolts, IMP-DL-DB751-BK deadbolt, IMP-DL-DB751-626 deadbolt, Satin Black ADA Compliant Single Cylinder Deadbolts, Single Cylinder Handicap Door Locks, matte black deadbolts, satin chrome deadbolts"
